# Ignore file for `docker build -f agents/Dockerfile .` (context = repo root).
#
# NOTE ON LOCATION: the build context is the repo ROOT, so Docker/BuildKit does
# NOT read `agents/.dockerignore`. For a build with `-f agents/Dockerfile`,
# BuildKit reads THIS file (`<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore`), falling back to a
# root-level `.dockerignore`. Patterns below are relative to the context root.
#
# Critical: keep `agents/.env` (real secrets) OUT of the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/venv/
agents/docker-compose.yml
